From 159850628cbe6b89379e93b5e4cde714637a8c09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: locus84 <locus84@andestech.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jan 2025 16:04:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 33/53] andes: spi: SPI support data merge mode (#142)

Currently, SPI Supports data merge mode, each time the data is written,
the register will send all four bytes of the written data.

Each read from the Data Register will retrieve four bytes
of received data as a single word data.

Signed-off-by: locus84 <locus84@andestech.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gitea.andestech.com/RD-SW/u-boot.official/pulls/142
Reviewed-by: Tim Shih-Ting OuYang <tim609@andestech.com>
Reviewed-by: CL Chin-Long Wang <cl634@andestech.com>
Co-authored-by: locus84 <locus84@andestech.com>
Co-committed-by: locus84 <locus84@andestech.com>
